# Run a full map-calibration session over a calibration plan.
#
# All string paths support `$(find pkg)/...`, `~`, and `$VAR` expansion. If
# left empty, the corresponding yaml default from map_calibrator.yaml is used.
#
# - plan_path     : path to calibration_plan.yaml
# - ref_tags_path : path to reference_tags.yaml
# - map_in_path   : path to the source map.yaml (used read-only for base
#                   nav metadata; never mutated)
# - map_out_path  : path to write the WORLD-FRAME map_world.yaml (atomic
#                   write each step). NOTE: this is NOT a drop-in for
#                   apriltag_nav's map.yaml — coordinates live in the
#                   world frame defined by reference_tags.yaml, NOT the
#                   Manipulator/Map frame.
#                   "" => default ~/.ros/path_tag_locator/map_world_<ts>.yaml
# - dry_run       : if true, no /cmd_vel, no MoveJ, no map_out write —
#                   the node only parses the plan and reports what it would do.
string plan_path
string ref_tags_path
string map_in_path
string map_out_path
bool   dry_run
---
bool   success
string message
int32  num_succeeded
int32  num_failed
string output_yaml_path
